  "note": "Election of the Warrenpoint Urban District Council, 15 May 1939. East Ward (5 seats) was uncontested; West Ward (7 seats) had nine candidates. The result was unusual: two candidates tied with 212 votes for the second lowest place, and the returning officer drew one name from a hat."
